        "cmd": "python3 -c \"import pathlib; t=pathlib.Path('docs/design-worker-parallel.md').read_text(encoding='utf-8'); need=['## 模型','## 租约与心跳','## 隔离保证','## 错误隔离','## 与 dispatch 的关系','## 落地建议']; missing=[s for s in need if s not in t]; assert not missing, f'缺少必备小节: {missing}'\"",
